  "title": "Use the Sandwich Technique for Difficult Conversations",
  "description": "Start with a positive comment, address the difficulty, and end with another positive comment. For example, 'I really appreciate how you always help with dinner. I’ve noticed we’ve been arguing more lately and it’s affecting our relationship. I know we can work through this together because we’re a strong team.'",
